        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for kubevirt1.8 fixes the following issues:\n\nSecurity issues fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-13622: virt-handler migration proxy follows symlinks allowing container escape to host (bsc#1272840).\n\nNon security issue fixed:\n\n- KubeVirt fails to start on Tumbleweed (bsc#1272604).\n\n",
